*.sln.docstates

# Ignore package restore
**/packages/
**/node_modules/

# Ignore documentation
*.md
docs/
PHASE*_SUMMARY.md

# Ignore Docker files in subdirectories
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile

# Ignore GitHub files
.github/

# Ignore temporary files
**/tmp/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
